{"id":"bw-34517","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/eve/时区-Timezones.wiki","title":{"zh":"时区"},"lang":"zh","source":"EVE 星战前夜 BWIKI","license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0（BWIKI）","blocks":[{"t":"p","zh":"<i>本页译自 EVE University Wiki：<a href=\"#guide/w/bw-34517\">Timezones</a></i>"},{"t":"p","zh":"为了方便活动安排，这里提供一个快速的时区转换表。"},{"t":"p","zh":"注意，由于各地实行/取消夏令时的时间不同，这些时间最坏情况下可能有一两个小时的偏差。好的做法是：所有活动时间<b>首先</b>以EVE时间（UTC）给出，之后再附上换算后的本地时间。每个玩家自己最清楚怎么把EVE时间换算成本地时间，同时考虑本地的计时规则。"},{"t":"p","zh":"24h format / 24小时制"},{"t":"table","hr":[true,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false],"zh":[["EVE(UTC)","Australia East(GMT+10)","UK(GMT)","CET(GMT+1)","US Pacific(GMT-8)"],["Fri 08:00","Fri 18:00","Fri 08:00","Fri 09:00","Thu 00:00"],["Fri 12:00","Fri 22:00","Fri 12:00","Fri 13:00","Fri 04:00"],["Fri 16:00","Sat 02:00","Fri 16:00","Fri 17:00","Fri 08:00"],["Fri 20:00","Sat 06:00","Fri 20:00","Fri 21:00","Fri 12:00"],["Sat 00:00","Sat 10:00","Sat 00:00","Sat 01:00","Fri 16:00"],["Sat 04:00","Sat 14:00","Sat 04:00","Sat 07:00","Fri 20:00"],["Sat 08:00","Sat 18:00","Sat 08:00","Sat 09:00","Sat 00:00"],["Sat 12:00","Sat 22:00","Sat 12:00","Sat 13:00","Sat 04:00"],["Sat 16:00","Sun 02:00","Sat 16:00","Sat 17:00","Sat 08:00"],["Sat 20:00","Sun 06:00","Sat 20:00","Sat 21:00","Sat 12:00"],["Sun 00:00","Sun 10:00","Sun 00:00","Sun 01:00","Sat 16:00"],["Sun 04:00","Sun 14:00","Sun 04:00","Sun 05:00","Sat 20:00"],["Sun 08:00","Sun 18:00","Sun 08:00","Sun 09:00","Sun 00:00"],["Sun 12:00","Sun 22:00","Sun 12:00","Sun 13:00","Sun 04:00"],["Sun 16:00","Mon 02:00","Sun 16:00","Sun 17:00","Sun 08:00"],["Sun 20:00","Mon 06:00","Sun 20:00","Sun 21:00","Sun 12:00"],["Mon 00:00","Mon 10:00","Mon 00:00","Mon 01:00","Sun 16:00"],["Mon 04:00","Mon 14:00","Mon 04:00","Mon 05:00","Sun 20:00"],["Mon 08:00","Mon 18:00","Mon 08:00","Mon 09:00","Mon 00:00"]]},{"t":"table","hr":[true,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false